{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 161, "text": "给邓冰的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n邓冰C 1 ] 先生：\n去年十二月惠书敬悉，极为感谢。先生工作岗位，似以在\n原地为适宜，不必远游，未知以为然否？此复。顺祝\n教祺\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 邓冰，\n当时在广东龙川县景韩中学任教。\n1 32 \n丿\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "032ce58359d676024bf4df2a86f0d46de18a2b44e2d64a15297a236d5ee5442c", "text_chars": 141}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 162, "text": "给余长茂的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n棣芳[ 1\n好的，、望继续努力。此复，顺祝\n健康！\n硐\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 』棣芳，即余长茂，字棣芳，毛泽东青少年时期的同学。\n当\n时在湖南平江县任教。\n1 33 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "762dc1390876b663b7665ed12e1e82c14c0449366f5f231ebf8500e116e40e58", "text_chars": 125}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 163, "text": "给凌汉秋的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n汉秋C l ] 先生：\n去年十二月二十一日来信收到，甚为感谢。工作问题，请\n在当地设法解决，不要来北京，\n因京中人浮千事，不易解决。\n此复，顺颂\n大安\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 汉秋，即凌汉秋，\n当时家住湖南株洲。\n1 34 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "2e15a09a4b1994d014162fe3c78a40fabf28987da74af0761f872feb7eedfa55", "text_chars": 150}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 164, "text": "给庄严的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n庄严( 1 ) 学兄：\n去\n；\n十二月十日惠书敬悉，极为感谢。吾兄从事教育是很\n好的，\n望继续努力。风便尚祈时示周行。敬颂\n教祺\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC l 』庄严，毛泽东青少年时期的同学。\n当时在湖南南县协安乡\n中心国民学校任教。\n1 35 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "e67da0a5a29af195402bc49bdcec61016a8739c4fc501ca8b234d9333e899787", "text_chars": 160}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 165, "text": "给文士员的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n士员C 1 ] 学兄：\n四月二十五日来信收到，极为感谢。吾兄从事教育工作极\n好，\n尚望努力进修，改进人民教育事业。此复，敬颂\n教祺\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 士员，即文士员，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的同学。当时在长沙市育群中学任教。\n13 6 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "497a7977b44e8f6c6991b4f4d74a2d5aa1d3b4182ed4afb5e28d79547c19a97a", "text_chars": 170}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 166, "text": "、、\n给赵浦珠的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n浦珠( l ] 先生姻兄左右：\n惠书及大作( 2 ] 收到敬悉，甚为感谢。乡间减租土改等事，\n弟因不悉具体情形，未便直接干与，请与当地人民政府诸同志\n妥为接洽，期得持平解决。风便尚祈时示周行。唐家托诸亲友\n并致问候之意。此复，顺颂\n健吉\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\n浦珠，\n即赵浦珠，是毛泽东七舅母的侄子，毛泽覃发妻赵\n珠在土戎中被划为地主成分后，写信给毛泽东请求帮助。\n大作，指赵浦珠一九五0年春作的七绝八首。诗中抒发了\n他对中国人民解放军、地方人民政府和当时社会情况等的新鲜感受。\n1 37 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "c9c0c1f60c230c6267fdaa6682d3c87410feb377faf1a4d82d03ac4da089f1a1", "text_chars": 286}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 167, "text": "给粟济他的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n济世C 1 ] 先生：\n一月一日惠书敬悉，极为感谢。征粮弊病甚多，政府已有\n令[ 2 ] 纠正，未知实际效果如何？剿匪取宽大政策期收速效，\n根治则有待于土地制度之改革。先生如有所见，\n尚祈随时赐示\n为盼。顺颂\n健吉！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 济世，即粟济世，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的同学。\nC 2 J 政府巳有令，指政务院总理周恩来一九五0年二月二十八\n日署名发布、《人民日报》三月一日发表的《关于新解放区土地改革\n及征收公粮的指示》。指示说：最近一次新区征粮任务很重，征粮办\n法有缺点，发生了不少严重问题，必须纠正和补救。指示规定：\n中\n央人民政府所征收的公粮，在新区不到农业总收入的百分之十七，\n地方人民政府附加公粮不得超过正粮的百分之十五。各地人民政府\n138 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "39adbdae73b2faee48c82c26bba2ba441bfefcdab83f7519ff51f529d8fd2c21", "text_chars": 384}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 168, "text": "有加重地方公粮者，应予纠正。对地主征收额最高者不得超过其农\n业总收\n的百分之六十，其有特殊情形者，亦不得超过百分之八十，\n超过者\n；\n适当减轻。如巳全部征收者，应即退还一部。指示还对地\n主没有\n行减租或巳收预租者、\n巳实行二五减租者、地主完全收不\n到租或1 农完全不缴租者，如何征收公粮的问题作出规定。\n1 3 9  \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "320f8de59c0ab17559199dce04239a57cbcda5cdf3cb45ab6d2811c66282bd1c", "text_chars": 160}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 169, "text": "给林谷生的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n谷生C 1 ] 先生：\n三月十日来信收到。林蔚C 2 ] 同志死事极可痛惜，将来自\n应与全国各地死难同志一同有所纪念。此复，顺颂\n大安\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\n( l J 谷生，\n即林谷生，革命烈士林蔚的哥哥。\n( 2 J 林蔚，字家沂，号乔生，\n一九一九年赴法国勤工俭学，\n一\n九二二年夏加入中国共产党。\n曾任中共湖南秘密临时省委成员、湖\n南省委组织部部长。\n一九二八年三月在湖南醴陵被国民党军队杀害。\n1 40 \n/＇ \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "00a7d93a6ce0171103d0cb7b437e8a00fa9678356196a8a827777b19e93b263c", "text_chars": 249}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 170, "text": "给周振岳的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n振岳( 1 ] 先生：\n去年十月九日来信收到，甚慰。参加工作事尚望就近设\n法。此复，顺颂\n大安\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\n｀振岳，\n即周振岳，\n一九二五年曾护送毛泽东由长沙去广\n州，并进入第五届广州农民运动讲习所学习。\n当时家住湖南湘潭西\n1 4 1  \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "f58e6641e6f5478ba351ca24de31832821d831a14e23d6a6bb9972a9ba54cbc3", "text_chars": 163}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 171, "text": "给李鑫的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n李鑫C 1 ] 先生：\n去年十二月来信收到。工作问题，应在当地设法解决，不\n要来北京。此复，顺祝\n进步\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 李鑫，又名李长霖，早年曾和毛泽东共过事。当时在江苏\n吴县务农。\n1 42 \ni'\n \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "90dd746c54d945d9099e415e555b3dce493eb4fc348fbf0a321b06622602a306", "text_chars": 148}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 172, "text": "给陈国生的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n国生( 1 ] 贤甥青览：\n来信收到，甚慰。望你们在湖南设法求得工作，不要来北\n京。乡1回情形可来信告我。此问\n近好！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 国生，即陈国生，毛泽东堂妹毛泽建的过继女儿。\n当时家\n住湖南湘乡县。\n1 43 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "793bb29b1167274aa108a4be12e5a773dc3118f89587a9385d9ffbd07257050f", "text_chars": 155}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 173, "text": "给毛贻华的信\n（一九五0 年五月七日）\n贻华C l J 先生：\n三月九日来信收到。工作事尚望就近设法解决，我现在难\n千为助，\n尚祈鉴谅。此复，顺祝\n健康\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月七日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 贻华，即毛贻华，毛泽东的房叔。\n144 \n， \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "c52e70d841bea5855ac3d12c5dbef89adb081c4c8dd3560f54d1c39248d6f431", "text_chars": 130}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 174, "text": "给毛逸民的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n逸民( 1 ] 同志：\n－－三日来信收到，感谢你的好意，感谢你详细地将乡里\n情形告诉我。\n耐一点，待土地改革后就可能好一些了，那时人民政府也可能\n给人民以一些帮助，例如贷款等，人民就可以逐步改善自己的\n生活。\n烈属的照顾是全国范围内的事，全国有几百万户烈属，都\n要照顾，\n自未便单独地特殊地照顾少数地方。但最困难的人\n民，\n当地人民政府在减租时、土改时及青黄不接的岁月，应当\n尽可能给以照顾。\n你在乡里做工作，\n很好，\n可以常常来信，\n告我以乡中\n情形。i\n请尔替我问候乡里的同志们，希望大家努力和进步。\n此复，顺祝\n健康！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n1 45 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "b115ade0b4bd3f7fb46e160425b1a53f73e34ceea6fc32e2c9c38ed8174c0014", "text_chars": 313}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 175, "text": "注\n释\nC 1 J 逸民，\n即毛逸民，毛泽东的族叔，\n当时任中共湘潭县第三\n区区委宣传委员。\n146 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "8ec4a32c5f427b117d17a90aeac827bed2082ef11cc84f9e6ef3fe60487cb9b3", "text_chars": 52}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 176, "text": "给陈峰仙的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n怡君C l ] 同志：\n去年十一月来信收到，极为欣慰。希望你努力进修，\n为人\n民事业\n：\n续工作。齐秦（泰〉( 2 J 情形不清楚，你可以写信去汉\n口第四\n战军政治部询问或可得其梗概。此复。顺祝\n健康！\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 怡君，\n即陈峰仙，字怡君，李求实的夫人。\n当时在重庆大\n学做女生宿舍管理员。\nC 2\n1J 齐泰，\n即李齐泰，是李求实和陈峰仙的儿子。\n当时在长春\n航空学校学习。\n147 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "b8c95d78a67df7266e852aa06b936b8c6024ada96be6d9e1584554a85b37a626", "text_chars": 238}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 177, "text": "给周芝麟的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n芝麟( l ] 学兄：\n去年十二月惠书敬悉，\n甚为感谢。周玉麟( 2 ] 同志死事望\n兄就近陈明湖南当局备案，便与全国英烈一体议恤。此复，敬\n颂教祺\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 芝麟，即周芝麟，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的同学。\nC 2 J 周玉麟，周芝麟的弟弟，早年参加革命，\n一九二八年在长\n沙牺牲。\n148 \n/\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "d9d6daef4ee848707f1dfbfe5a05541f9f4ccd8a20175c34feec086841b770d2", "text_chars": 200}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 178, "text": "给李静蓉、李炳奎的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n＿ \n灿英( 1 ) 同志：\n去年十一月十三日来信收到，极为欣慰。在莫斯科时曾看\n见志成( 2 ) ，情形是好的，大约不要很久可以毕业回国。\n健康\n你在湖南工作很好，如工作需要，不必来北京。\n此复，顺祝\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月八日\n＿ ＿ \n炳奎( 3 ) 先生：\n去年十月来信收到。郭亮、李灿英同志之子尚在苏联求\n学，大约不久可以学成归国。此复，顺祝\n康吉\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n149 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "45dce46a8309f74983fe9062f178be82e292f0f70d57fe4f6b9bc070fee9859e", "text_chars": 230}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 179, "text": "注\n释\nC 1 J 灿英，即李静蓉，原名李灿英，郭亮的夫人。毛泽东回信\n时，李灿英巳因病去世，生前任湖南衡阳市民主妇女联合会主任。\n郭亮，湖南早期的工人运动领导人之一，\n一九二一年冬加入中国共\n产党。\n曾任湖南省总工会委员长、中共湖南省委代理书记、湖北省\n委书记、湘鄂赣边特委书记。\n一九二八年三月在长沙牺牲。\nC 2 J 志成，即郭志成，郭亮、李灿英的儿子。\n一九五一年六月\n从莫斯科动力学院毕业归国。\nC 3 J 炳奎，即李炳奎，郭亮夫人李灿英的哥哥。\n1 50 \n／\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "15e1d1a4632a2f7893c0df5eb8fe488e4b8cd9b1eb7e98b344c719ca109e4ad4", "text_chars": 237}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 180, "text": "｀｀ \n给黄谱臣的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n谱臣( l J 兄：\n一月二十四日来信收到，很高兴。兄在广西铁路方面工\n作，很：，希望你继续努力此项工作，不必往别处，也不必回\n乡。你\n夫人是否仍是罗合楼( 2 ] 先生的次女，如是，请替我\n向她致问候之意。此复，顺颂\n大安！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n注\n释\nC 1 J 谱臣，即黄谱臣，毛泽东元配罗氏的妹夫。\nC 2 J 罗合楼，毛泽东元配罗氏的父亲。\n根据手稿刊印。\n1 5 1  \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "cd03a6f31f1a0f7e0dd79ef60626993195f51d2960f8f4f577d0070423ca9456", "text_chars": 222}
